title: CharacterFL
---
{$characterFLName}: Hello, {$playerName}.
<<if has_item("special_gift")>>
    {$characterFLName}: Is something wrong?
    -> Give her the Special Gift
        {$playerName}: Actually, I have something for you.
        {$characterFLName}: For me?
        {$playerName}: I thought you might like it.
        <<remove_item GameManager "special_gift">>
        <<change_affection GameManager "characterfour" 15>>
        {$characterFLName}: It's beautiful...
        {$characterFLName}: Thank you, {$playerName}. I really like it.
    -> Keep the gift
        {$playerName}: No, it's nothing.
        {$characterFLName}: Alright...
<<else>>
    {$characterFLName}: It's good to see you.
<<endif>>
===